      en: "The Condamine Urban Canyon is an artificial canyon in the Condamine district, created by dense high-rise buildings. It stretches along Rue Grimaldi and is up to 30 meters deep. Buildings on both sides are up to 20 stories high. The canyon formed by building on the slope between the harbor and the Condamine Plateau. It creates its own microclimate with less wind and more shade. The canyon is a popular shopping area.",
